    "sentence_translations": [
      "Grandma’s White Hair",
      "",
      "Little Ming is a seven-year-old boy. He is very naughty and does things that make his mom unhappy every day.",
      "He drew on the ground using his mom’s lipstick. He cut the dog’s whiskers.",
      "He also put his grandma’s newly bought hat into water, while saying, “Hat boat, hat boat” …",
      "",
      "Little Ming’s mom came up with a good idea. She said to Little Ming, “Don’t make me angry again.”",
      "",
      "Little Ming asked, “Why?”",
      "",
      "His mom said, “Because every time you make me angry, I’ll have one more white hair.",
      "If you are always making me angry, I’ll become an old lady.”",
      "",
      "After hearing what his mom said, Little Ming thought about it and said, ..",
      ".. “I finally understand why grandma’s hair is white.”"
    ]
